# Docker matches these patterns from the context root and does not recurse
# implicitly, so every pattern needs the **/ prefix to also apply inside apps/.
.git
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.output
# Built inside the image by `build:worker`. A copy from somebody's laptop must
# never be what ships.
**/worker/dist
**/.tanstack
**/.local-storage
**/.playwright-cli
**/public/local-media
